+// Source of truth (tools/wb_serve.cpp, read 20261010):
+//   CsvToJson            :1407-1455   lines split on '\n' only; last piece kept only if non-empty
+//   SplitCsv             :1356-1375   split on ',' (no quoting), every '\r' AND '\n' byte dropped
